h as the GNU General Public License (GPL) and the Creative Commons Attribution-Sharealike license (CC-BY-SA).","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viral_license","original_url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Viral_license"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eL1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f86f1f3-0212-4be0-b6f8-c994e318e36d","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/minad/mimemagic\u003e\nなるほど。これのライセンスがMIT-\u0026gt;GPL-2に変わったんですね","ts":"1616638903.035600","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: minad/mimemagic","id":1,"title":"minad/mimemagic","title_link":"https://github.com/minad/mimemagic","text":"Mime type detection in ruby via file extension or file content - minad/mimemagic","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50754?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":420,"thumb_height":420,"from_url":"https://github.com/minad/mimemagic","original_url":"https://github.com/minad/mimemagic"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jh+om"}]},{"client_msg_id":"febc6b35-e5cb-489b-aaa9-b4c20b368c14","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"面倒くさい話になってるなぁ","ts":"1616638513.035100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u+0e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c285ca1-5b28-4c01-a9d9-e451ca00f4b9","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"彼はわかってて書いてそうだけど、読んでる多く人に誤解を与えそうなので明示しておくと、GPLは感染なんてしません\n\u003chttp://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/09/gpl.html\u003e","ts":"1616637537.034800","attachments":[{"fallback":"漢(オトコ)のコンピュータ道: GPLは感染するか否か","id":1,"title":"GPLは感染するか否か","title_link":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/09/gpl.html","text":"前回のエントリ において、GPLに対するFUDについて触れたところ、 というコメントを頂いてしまった。ちょッ、代表ッ！！と言いたいところであるが、これは視点を変えると現在はGPLに対するFUDが成功してしまっている状況なので変えなくてはマズイという認識に至った。 @tmtms氏...","image_url":"http://3.bp.blogspot.com/_3l-X4JQ1EX4/TJnWBrhhasI/AAAAAAAAAdY/wQmKEO6ksjQ/w1200-h630-p-k-no-nu/tmtms_twitter-fud.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"漢(オトコ)のコンピュータ道","service_icon":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/favicon.ico","from_url":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/09/gpl.html","original_url":"http://nippondanji.blogspot.com/2010/09/gpl.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YHqm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"457d17e7-6d83-4e11-a49d-69d4d9344bb7","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/shyouhei/status/1374712362259804172\u003e","ts":"1616636876.033900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/shyouhei|@shyouhei\u003e: おおお？突如としてrailsがGPL に感染した \u003chttps://github.com/rails/rails/issues/41750\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"7594591200220899443","author_subname":"@shyouhei","author_link":"https://twitter.com/shyouhei/status/1374712362259804172","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/459710955748732928/jBjYAHBT_normal.jpeg","text":"おおお？突如としてrailsがGPL に感染した \u003chttps://github.com/rails/rails/issues/41750\u003e","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1616591942,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/shyouhei/status/1374712362259804172","original_url":"https://twitter.com/shyouhei/status/1374712362259804172"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z6e"}]}]
